    <string name="welcome_title">Your safety, in your control.</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Cercle Rouge alerts your trusted people if you need help. It does not predict danger: it helps you raise the alarm fast.</string>
    <string name="welcome_sos_hint">The SOS button works right now.</string>
    <string name="ia_title">The AI listens on your phone. Nothing is sent.</string>
    <string name="ia_body">When you turn protection on, your phone recognises words like “Anmwe” or “Help”. Audio stays on your phone. An icon always shows the microphone is on.</string>
    <string name="ia_limits">The AI can make mistakes. The SOS button is the most reliable.</string>
